  "items": [
    {
      "source": "the instance of this SimpleJdbcCall",
      "translation": "该 SimpleJdbcCall 实例",
      "count": 8
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the stored procedure and return a map of output params, keyed by name\nas in parameter declarations.",
      "translation": "执行存储过程并返回一个输出参数映射，键为参数声明中的名称。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the stored function and return the results obtained as an Object of the\nspecified return type.",
      "translation": "执行存储函数并返回指定返回类型的结果对象。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the type of the value to return",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 要返回的值的类型",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the stored procedure and return the single out parameter as an Object\nof the specified return type.",
      "translation": "执行存储过程并将单个输出参数返回为指定返回类型的 Object。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the stored procedure and return the single out parameter as an Object\nof the specified return type. In the case where there are multiple out parameters,\nthe first one is returned and additional out parameters are ignored.",
      "translation": "执行存储过程并将单个输出参数作为指定返回类型的 Object 返回。如果有多个输出参数，则返回第一个，并忽略其他输出参数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>args</code> - a Map containing the parameter values to be used in the call",
      "translation": "<code>args</code> - 包含要在调用中使用的参数值的 Map",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>args</code> - the MapSqlParameterSource containing the parameter values to be used in the call",
      "translation": "<code>args</code> - 包含要在调用中使用的参数值的 MapSqlParameterSource",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>args</code> - optional array containing the in parameter values to be used in the call.\nParameter values must be provided in the same order as the parameters are defined for\nthe stored procedure.",
      "translation": "`args` - 可选数组，包含要在调用中使用的输入参数值。\n必须按照存储过程中定义参数的顺序提供参数值。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "a Map of output params",
      "translation": "输出参数的 Map",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that only parameters declared as <code>SqlParameter</code> and <code>SqlInOutParameter</code>\nwill be used to provide input values. This is different from the <code>StoredProcedure</code>\nclass which - for backwards compatibility reasons - allows input values to be provided\nfor parameters declared as <code>SqlOutParameter</code>.",
      "translation": "请注意，只有声明为 `<code>SqlParameter</code>` 和 `<code>SqlInOutParameter</code>` 的参数将用于提供输入值。这与 `<code>StoredProcedure</code>` 类不同，出于向后兼容的原因，该类允许为声明为 `<code>SqlOutParameter</code>` 的参数提供输入值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The actual call is being handled using Spring's <a href=\"../JdbcTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcTemplate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实际的调用是使用 Spring 的<a href=\"../JdbcTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcTemplate</code></a>处理的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The meta-data processing is based on the DatabaseMetaData provided by\nthe JDBC driver. Since we rely on the JDBC driver, this \"auto-detection\"\ncan only be used for databases that are known to provide accurate meta-data.\nThese currently include Derby, MySQL, Microsoft SQL Server, Oracle, DB2,\nSybase and PostgreSQL. For any other databases you are required to declare\nall parameters explicitly. You can of course declare all parameters\nexplicitly even if the database provides the necessary meta-data. In that\ncase your declared parameters will take precedence. You can also turn off\nany meta-data processing if you want to use parameter names that do not\nmatch what is declared during the stored procedure compilation.",
      "translation": "元数据处理基于 JDBC 驱动程序提供的 DatabaseMetaData。由于我们依赖 JDBC 驱动程序，这种“自动检测”仅适用于已知能提供准确元数据的数据库。目前包括 Derby、MySQL、Microsoft SQL Server、Oracle、DB2、Sybase 和 PostgreSQL。对于任何其他数据库，您需要显式声明所有参数。即使数据库提供了必要的元数据，您当然也可以显式声明所有参数；在这种情况下，您声明的参数将具有优先权。如果您希望使用与存储过程编译期间声明的名称不匹配的参数名称，还可以关闭任何元数据处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Many of the configuration methods return the current instance of the\nSimpleJdbcCall in order to provide the ability to chain multiple ones\ntogether in a \"fluent\" interface style.",
      "translation": "许多配置方法返回当前 SimpleJdbcCall 实例，以便能够以“流式”接口风格将多个方法链式调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "To provide consistency with the Oracle DatabaseMetaData, this is used to specify the\npackage name if the procedure is declared as part of a package.",
      "translation": "为了与 Oracle DatabaseMetaData 保持一致，此参数用于指定当过程声明为包的一部分时的包名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the database you are using uses ref cursors then the name specified must match\nthe name of the parameter declared for the procedure in the database.",
      "translation": "如果您使用的数据库使用引用游标，则指定的名称必须与数据库中为该过程声明的参数名称匹配。",
      "count": 2
    },
